CORE
main.c
--add-library --dump-c _ --no-standard-checks
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^  return __CPROVER_fmaf\(x, y, z\);$
^  return __CPROVER_fmal\(x, y, z\);$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
return fma\(
--
The library models of fmaf and fmal must be dumped using the precision-specific
built-in rather than a call to fma, which would compute in double precision.
